# Concept DOI: resolves to the current version, so it stays correct inside every
# archived snapshot. Release v1.0.0 has version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22849684.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22849683"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-19"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SZabolotnii/Ku-PMM3-MLE-TN-code-supplement"
abstract: >-
  R code and stored Monte Carlo results comparing the third-order polynomial
  maximization method (PMM3), maximum likelihood for the Two-piece Normal
  distribution (MLE-TN) and OLS for linear regression with symmetric
  platykurtic errors.
keywords:
  - polynomial maximization method
  - PMM3
  - two-piece normal distribution
  - maximum likelihood
  - linear regression
  - platykurtic errors
  - Monte Carlo
